## View wiring note (honest)
benchmarkRoute accepts optional benchmarkPreferences/benchmarkActiveRun readbacks as the 8th/9th args. The live shell works without view changes because ReadbackLoaded hydrates judge preference and starts active-run polling. The SSR initial render does NOT have preferences/active-run until that update arrives; passing the two readbacks in view.ts is what closes that first-render gap. No product view file was changed by this task.
